<v Host>This penguin is a northern rockhopper penguin.

00:03:32.240 --> 00:03:41.575
<v Slow>目のあたりから頭の後ろにかけて、黄色い飾りの羽があるのが特徴です。

00:03:42.376 --> 00:03:47.223
<v Host>Its feature is the yellow decorative feathers from around the eyes to the back of the head.

00:03:47.824 --> 00:03:50.199
